      "id": "AD4",
      "title": "Install exact rational frames without changing the carried lattice",
      "statement": "Prescribe M_P at finitely many oriented primes and conjugate(M_P)^(-transpose) at their conjugates. Unitarity and two-direction local integrality show the same lattice is carried; all pullbacks away from that finite set remain exact. This proves exists_modify and isolates the initial genus/reduction supplier.",
      "status": "derived_simplification",
      "mathematical_status": "proved_under_explicit_hypotheses",
      "depends_on": [
        "AD2",
        "LP2",
        "LP3"
      ],
