        "expanded": "adelic_geometry/report.txt",
        "section": "AD4"
      },
      "assumptions": [
        "The original CM field, involution, localizations and finite adelic algebra are supplied.",
        "AD3 assumes actual realizers and local neighbor identities; AD4 assumes an initial unitary realizer and compatible rational local bases.",
        "General self-dual-lattice genus and decorated-point realization are not inferred from these constructions."
      ],
